{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Non-good reference, untwisting limit of the two one-parameter pair-1 families\n\nSetting (diagonal/physical frame, ABJM chain A F A F ...; conventions of `abjm-bridges.wb` and `ABJM-3pt-transfer-matrices.md` 2, 5.5-5.7). All symbols prefixed `ng`. Bras are row vectors; a site rotation is written by the matrix that multiplies the bra site vector from the right (so the global torus gamma is `Lambda^-1` on A sites and `Lambda` on F sites).\n\nPlan: (0) setup, (1) constants c1, c12 and the families (a), (b) at finite twist, exact; (2) negative product check; (3) finite-twist identity on twisted HW states; (4) limit bra B*; (5) the 0*infinity table; (6) control family (b); (7) negative statement and chain; (8) summary.\n\nPair vectors: W_a = (e1 + a e4) (x) (e4 - a e1). Parametrisation used below: family (a) = bra.t1(th1)^-1 (alpha + beta t1(th2)); alpha' = alpha c1, beta' = beta c12; limit choice alpha' + beta' = c eps.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 0. Setup (chain, Laxes, transfer matrices as sparse matrices, product-state tools)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngn = 4; ngh = 1/2;\nngEE[i_, j_] := SparseArray[{{i, j} -> 1}, {4, 4}];\nngRho[\"A\"][i_, j_] := ngEE[i, j]; ngRho[\"F\"][i_, j_] := -ngEE[j, i];\nngId4 = IdentityMatrix[4, SparseArray];\nngLax[ty_, v_, t_][i_, j_] := (v - t) KroneckerDelta[i, j] ngId4 + ngh ngRho[ty][i, j];\nngLaxBar[ty_, v_, t_][k_, l_] := If[ty == \"A\", (v - t + ngh) KroneckerDelta[k, l] ngId4 - ngh ngEE[l, k], (v - t - 3 ngh) KroneckerDelta[k, l] ngId4 + ngh ngEE[k, l]];\nngSetup[Lp_] := (ngLp = Lp; ngLL = 2 Lp; ngTypes = Flatten[Table[{\"A\", \"F\"}, Lp]]; ngTuples = Tuples[Range[4], ngLL];\n   ngSecOf[b_] := Total[MapThread[If[#2 == \"A\", 1, -1] UnitVector[4, #1] &, {b, ngTypes}]]; ngSectors = GroupBy[Range[4^ngLL], ngSecOf[ngTuples[[#]]] &]; ngCache = <||>; Null);\nngSiteOp[s_, m_] := KroneckerProduct @@ Table[If[b == s, m, ngId4], {b, ngLL}];\nngMono[lax_, ths_, v_] := Module[{T, s}, T = Table[ngSiteOp[1, lax[ngTypes[[1]], v, ths[[1]]][i, j]], {i, 4}, {j, 4}];\n   Do[T = Table[Sum[T[[i, k]] . ngSiteOp[s, lax[ngTypes[[s]], v, ths[[s]]][k, j]], {k, 4}], {i, 4}, {j, 4}], {s, 2, ngLL}]; T];\nngT1[ths_, z_, v_] := Module[{T = ngMono[ngLax, ths, v]}, Sum[T[[i, i]] z[[i]], {i, 4}]];\nngT3b[ths_, z_, v_] := Module[{T = ngMono[ngLaxBar, ths, v], Gb = Times @@ z/z}, Sum[T[[i, i]] Gb[[i]], {i, 4}]];\nngE[i_] := UnitVector[4, i];\nngW[a_] := {ngE[1] + a ngE[4], ngE[4] - a ngE[1]};\nngProd[sv_List] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ sv];\nngPairsW[a_, Lp_] := Join @@ Table[ngW[a], Lp];\n(* product-state tools *)\nngFlat[b_, s_] := Module[{T = ArrayReshape[b, ConstantArray[4, ngLL]], perm}, perm = Join[{s}, Delete[Range[ngLL], s]]; ArrayReshape[Transpose[T, InversePermutation[perm]], {4, 4^(ngLL - 1)}]];\nngProdDefect[b_] := Max[Table[With[{sv = SingularValueList[N[ngFlat[b, s]]]}, If[Length[sv] < 2, 0., sv[[2]]/sv[[1]]]], {s, ngLL}]];\nngNormV[v_] := v/v[[Ordering[Abs[v], -1][[1]]]];\nngSiteVecs[b_] := Table[Module[{M = ngFlat[b, s], k}, k = Ordering[Norm /@ Transpose[M], -1][[1]]; ngNormV[M[[All, k]]]], {s, ngLL}];\nngSetup[2];\nGrid[{{\"pairs\", ngLp}, {\"sites\", ngLL}, {\"dim\", 4^ngLL}, {\"sectors\", Length[ngSectors]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"188\" data-out-n=\"1637\" data-sub-idx=\"21\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"23\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1637]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtwYWlyc30gJiAyXFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtzaXRlc30gJiA0XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtkaW19ICYgMjU2XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtzZWN0b3JzfSAmIDU1XFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pairs</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sites</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sectors</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">55</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1637]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{pairs} & 2\\\\\\hline\\text{sites} & 4\\\\\\hline\\text{dim} & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{sectors} & 55\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "741f5173-c4c3-4b01-8a8f-3912fa39b58b"
