   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. The two families at finite twist, exactly (rational point)\n\nPoint: h = 1/2, theta = (2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8), z = (3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7), a = 1/3 (`W_a^L`, non-good: u.Lambda v = a(z4 - z1) != 0), plus BPS product references with random rational pair vectors (v.u = 0), pairs identical or independent. Exact rational linear algebra. For each reference we extract:\n\n- `r1`: bra.t1(th1)^-1 = r1 * bra.rho1(Lambda^-1), (compare r1 with c1 = 1/(h th12 (th13+h) th14));\n- `r12`: bra.t1(th1)^-1 t1(th2) = r12 * bra.rho1(Lambda^-1) rho2(Lambda), i.e. c12 := r12.\n\nEach entry shows the exact deviation from a constant ratio (should be 0) and the constant.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngRatio[x_, y_] := Module[{k = Select[Range[Length[y]], y[[#]] =!= 0 &], r, kz = Select[Range[Length[y]], y[[#]] === 0 &]}, r = x[[k]]/y[[k]]; {First[r], Max[Abs[Append[r - First[r], 0]]], If[kz === {}, 0, Max[Abs[x[[kz]]]]]}];\nngInvAct[bra_, Tm_] := LinearSolve[Transpose[Tm], bra];\nngTh0 = {2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8}; ngZ0 = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7}; ngA0 = 1/3;\nngC1[th_] := 1/(ngh Product[If[ngTypes[[s]] == \"F\", th[[1]] - th[[s]], th[[1]] - th[[s]] + ngh], {s, 2, ngLL}]);\nngRotSite[sv_, s_, M_] := ReplacePart[sv, s -> sv[[s]] . M];\nngConstTest[sv_, th_, z_] := Module[{bra = ngProd[sv], T1a, T1b, y1, y2, Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z], e1, e12, LamI = DiagonalMatrix[1/z]},\n   T1a = ngT1[th, z, th[[1]]]; T1b = ngT1[th, z, th[[2]]];\n   y1 = ngInvAct[bra, T1a]; y2 = y1 . T1b;\n   e1 = ngProd[ngRotSite[sv, 1, LamI]]; e12 = ngProd[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[sv, 1, LamI], 2, Lam]];\n   {ngRatio[y1, e1], ngRatio[y2, e12]}];\nSeedRandom[7];\nngRandPair[] := Module[{v = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, 4], r = RandomInteger[{-5, 5}, 4], u}, u = r - (r . v)/(v . v) v; {v, u}];\nngRefW = ngPairsW[ngA0, 2];\nngPR = ngRandPair[]; ngRefSame = Join[ngPR, ngPR];\nngRefIndep = Join[ngRandPair[], ngRandPair[]];\nngRefs = {\"W_a^2 (a=1/3)\" -> ngRefW, \"BPS random, identical pairs\" -> ngRefSame, \"BPS random, independent pairs\" -> ngRefIndep};\nngConstRes = (# -> ngConstTest[#2, ngTh0, ngZ0]) & @@@ ngRefs;\nngc1val = ngC1[ngTh0];\nGrid[Prepend[Map[{#[[1]], #[[2, 1, 1]], #[[2, 1, 2]], #[[2, 1, 3]], #[[2, 2, 1]], #[[2, 2, 2]], #[[2, 2, 3]]} &, ngConstRes], {\"reference\", \"r1\", \"dev r1\", \"zero-comp\", \"r12 = c12\", \"dev r12\", \"zero-comp\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"190\" data-out-n=\"1667\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1667]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.8553em;vertical-align:-2.1577em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6977em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.6577em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6577em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8153em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.1577em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6577em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.8177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reference</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">W_a</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2 (a=1/3)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BPS random, identical pairs</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.2023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BPS random, independent pairs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1577em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8153em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.1577em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6577em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.8177em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">r1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6126em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">25947</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">603680</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.4074em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">25947</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">603680</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.2023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"><