-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.1577em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6577em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6577em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6577em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1153em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6577em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3153em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6577em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1577em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1667]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{reference} & \\text{r1} & \\text{dev r1} & \\text{zero-comp} & \\text{r12 = c12} & \\text{dev r12} & \\text{zero-comp}\\\\\\hline\\text{W\\_a\\^{}2 (a=1/3)} & \\frac{603680}{25947} & 0 & 0 & -\\frac{78694}{20925} & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{BPS random, identical pairs} & \\frac{603680}{25947} & 0 & 0 & -\\frac{78694}{20925} & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{BPS random, independent pairs} & \\frac{29833744864}{1272414933} & \\frac{728004636128}{57258671985} & \\frac{813458800}{1922961} & -\\frac{403323621043}{41045643000} & \\frac{678246083837}{6840940500} & \\frac{3121436857}{11165580}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "188ee359-b5c9-46a2-8d70-b9f7f2db85f0"
    }
