   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1b. Closed forms and the families (a), (b), exact\n\nFrom the previous cell: r1 = c1 exactly (W_a and BPS references with identical pairs; for *independent* random pairs the end-site identities fail, so the reference must be the same pair repeated), and r12 = c12. Symbolic computation (row-vector transfer-matrix action on a product state, symbols `ngq1..4` for theta) gave\n\n  bra.rho1(Lambda^-1).t1(th2) = h th12 th23 (th24 - h) * bra.rho1(Lambda^-1) rho2(Lambda),   hence   **c12 = c1 h th12 th23 (th24 - h) = th23 (th24 - h) / ((th13 + h) th14)**  (L = 2 pairs).\n\nThen\n\n- (b): bra.(alpha + beta t1(th1)^-1) = bra.rho1(alpha + beta c1 Lambda^-1);\n- (a): bra.t1(th1)^-1 (alpha + beta t1(th2)) = bra.rho1(Lambda^-1) rho2(alpha' + beta' Lambda), **alpha' = alpha c1, beta' = beta c12**  (equivalently rho1(c1 Lambda^-1) rho2((alpha' + beta' Lambda)/c1)).\n\nThe cell below checks c12 against the measurement and both families, exactly (alpha = 3/5, beta = -2/7), reporting max |component difference| (0 = exact) and the product-state defect.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngC12[th_] := (th[[2]] - th[[3]]) (th[[2]] - th[[4]] - ngh)/((th[[1]] - th[[3]] + ngh) (th[[1]] - th[[4]]));\nngFam[sv_, th_, z_, al_, be_] := Module[{bra = ngProd[sv], T1a, T1b, y1, ya, yb, Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z], LamI = DiagonalMatrix[1/z], c1, c12, expA, expB, I4 = IdentityMatrix[4]},\n   c1 = ngC1[th]; c12 = ngC12[th];\n   T1a = ngT1[th, z, th[[1]]]; T1b = ngT1[th, z, th[[2]]];\n   y1 = ngInvAct[bra, T1a]; ya = al y1 + be (y1 . T1b); yb = al bra + be y1;\n   expB = ngProd[ngRotSite[sv, 1, al I4 + be c1 LamI]];\n   expA = ngProd[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[sv, 1, LamI], 2, al c1 I4 + be c12 Lam]];\n   {Max[Abs[yb - expB]], ngProdDefect[yb], Max[Abs[ya - expA]], ngProdDefect[ya]}];\nngChk12 = ngConstRes[[1, 2, 2, 1]] - ngC12[ngTh0];\nngFamRows = Map[Join[{#[[1]]}, ngFam[#[[2]], ngTh0, ngZ0, 3/5, -2/7]] &, {{\"W_a^2\", ngRefW}, {\"BPS identical pairs\", ngRefSame}}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"c12(measured) - c12(formula)\", ngChk12, \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"reference\", \"(b): max|bra - expected|\", \"(b) product defect\", \"(a): max|bra - expected|\", \"(a) product defect\"}}, ngFamRows], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
