   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Untwisted HW states and the twisted deformation (ABJM point, as in `abjm-bridges.wb` section 3)\n\nLoad `data/abjm-hw-states.wxf` key `L2` (untwisted, homogeneous at theta_A = theta_F + 2h, h = 1/2; HW, cyclic, joint t1, t3bar eigenstates; psi normalised, phase = largest component real positive; `C` = (C_0..C_4) of the project's bra B_l). The deformation is z = 1 + eps phi, theta = theta_ABJM + eps theta0 (theta_ABJM = (2h, 0, 2h, 0) = (1,0,1,0), theta0 = (2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8)). The twisted eigenvector is the eigenvector of the mixed twisted t1, t3bar combination (as in `abjm-bridges.wb`) restricted to the weight sector with the largest overlap with the HW state; phase and norm: ||Psi_eps|| = 1, <Psi0|Psi_eps> > 0. tau1(u) is read off exactly from the eigenvector.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngHWraw = Import[\"C:\\\\Users\\\\pryan\\\\git-projects\\\\abjm-c123\\\\Paul\\\\Mathematica\\\\su4-alternating\\\\data\\\\abjm-hw-states.wxf\"][\"L2\"];\nngHW = Map[<|\"psi\" -> N[Normal[#[\"psi\"]]], \"dyn\" -> #[\"dyn\"], \"E\" -> #[\"E\"], \"C\" -> N[Normal[#[\"C\"]]]|> &, ngHWraw];\nngThABJM = {1., 0., 1., 0.}; ngThDir = N[{2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8}];\nngPhi1 = {0.9, 0.4, -0.3, -1.1}; ngPhi2 = {1.3, -0.2, 0.5, -0.7};\nngMix[th_, z_] := ngT1[th, z, 0.3711] + 0.37 ngT1[th, z, -0.917] + 0.29 ngT3b[th, z, 0.41] - 0.13 ngT3b[th, z, -0.77];\nngIdxOf[psi_] := ngSectors[ngSecOf[ngTuples[[Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]]]]]];\nngTwisted[states_, th_, z_] := Module[{M = ngMix[th, z]}, Map[Function[st, Module[{idx = ngIdxOf[st[\"psi\"]], sub, vals, vecs, ov, k, p, d, full},\n      sub = Normal[M[[idx, idx]]]; {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[sub]; vecs = Normalize /@ vecs;\n      ov = Abs[Conjugate[vecs] . st[\"psi\"][[idx]]]; k = Ordering[ov, -1][[1]];\n      p = vecs[[k]]; d = Conjugate[st[\"psi\"][[idx]]] . p; p = p Abs[d]/d;\n      full = ConstantArray[0. + 0. I, 4^ngLL]; full[[idx]] = p; {full, ov[[k]], Sort[ov, Greater][[2]], Length[idx]}]], states]];\nngBraE11 = ngProd[Join[{ngE[1], ngE[1]}, Flatten[Table[{ngE[1], ngE[4]}, ngLp - 1], 1]]];\nngBraE44 = ngProd[Join[{ngE[4], ngE[4]}, Flatten[Table[{ngE[1], ngE[4]}, ngLp - 1], 1]]];\nngBraVac = ngProd[Flatten[Table[{ngE[1], ngE[4]}, ngLp], 1]];\nngX11 = ngBraE11 . #[\"psi\"] & /@ ngHW; ngX44 = ngBraE44 . #[\"psi\"] & /@ ngHW; ngVac0 = ngBraVac . #[\"psi\"] & /@ ngHW;\nGrid[Prepend[MapThread[{#1[\"dyn\"], #1[\"E\"], NumberForm[#1[\"C\"][[2]], 5], NumberForm[#2, 5], NumberForm[#3, 5], NumberForm[#4, 5]} &, {ngHW, ngX11, ngX44, ngVac0}], {\"Dynkin\", \"E_MZ\", \"C_1 (data)\", \"<e1e1 vac^(L-1)|Psi0>\", \"<e4e4 vac^(L-1)|Psi0>\", \"<vac^L|Psi0>\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"198\" data-out-n=\"1729\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1729]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dynkin</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2