  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Finite-twist identity and the 0*infinity table, family (a)\n\nParametrisation: beta' = 1, alpha' = c eps - 1, i.e. alpha = (c eps - 1)/c1, beta = 1/c12 (c1, c12 at the deformed theta), so alpha' + beta' Lambda = eps (c + phi_j) on the F site exactly, and\n\n  bra_eps := <W_a^L| t1(th1)^-1 (alpha + beta t1(th2)) = (eps (c+phi4)/z1) * N_eps,  N_eps = ((e1 + a (z1/z4) e4) (x) (e4 - a' e1)) (x) W_a^(L-1),  a' = a (c+phi1)/(c+phi4)  (exact at every eps).\n\nPer state and eps: `LHS_t` = <W|t1(th1)^-1 (alpha+beta t1(th2))|Psi_eps> evaluated with the transfer matrices (linear solve for the inverse), `RHS_tau` = (alpha + beta tau1(th2))/tau1(th1) * <W|Psi_eps>, `LHS_prod` = <bra_eps (product formula)|Psi_eps>, `T_eps` = <N_eps|Psi_eps>, and the predicted limit  <B*|Psi0> = <vac^L|Psi0> + (a - a')<e1e1 vac^(L-1)|Psi0>  (HW trick with the finite shift n = exp(-a E14)). a = 1/3, c = 2.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngRowA[st_, tw_, eps_, phi_, cp_, a_, X11_, V0_] := Module[{psi = tw[[1]], th = ngThABJM + eps ngThDir, z = 1 + eps phi, c1, c12, al, be, Wb, T1a, T1b, y1, lhsT, tau1, tau2, k, ovW, fac, lhsF, ap, braA, lhsP, Tn, lim, rest, facN},\n   c1 = ngC1[th]; c12 = ngC12[th]; al = (cp eps - 1)/c1; be = 1/c12;\n   Wb = ngProd[ngPairsW[a, ngLp]]; T1a = ngT1[th, z, th[[1]]]; T1b = ngT1[th, z, th[[2]]];\n   y1 = LinearSolve[Transpose[T1a], Wb]; lhsT = (al y1 + be (y1 . T1b)) . psi;\n   k = Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]]; tau1 = (T1a . psi)[[k]]/psi[[k]]; tau2 = (T1b . psi)[[k]]/psi[[k]];\n   ovW = Wb . psi; fac = (al + be tau2)/tau1; lhsF = fac ovW;\n   ap = a (cp + phi[[1]])/(cp + phi[[4]]); rest = Flatten[Table[ngW[a], ngLp - 1], 1];\n   braA = ngProd[Join[{ngE[1]/z[[1]] + a ngE[4]/z[[4]], eps (cp + phi[[4]]) (ngE[4] - ap ngE[1])}, rest]];\n   lhsP = braA . psi; facN = fac z[[1]]/(eps (cp + phi[[4]])); Tn = facN ovW; lim = V0 + (a - ap) X11;\n   <|\"eps\" -> eps, \"ov\" -> tw[[2]], \"ovW\" -> ovW, \"fac\" -> fac, \"facN\" -> facN, \"lhsT\" -> lhsT, \"lhsF\" -> lhsF, \"lhsP\" -> lhsP, \"Tn\" -> Tn, \"TnProd\" -> lhsP z[[1]]/(eps (cp + phi[[4]])), \"lim\" -> lim, \"ap\" -> ap|>];\nngTabA[phi_, cp_, a_, epss_] := Table[Module[{th = ngThABJM + eps ngThDir, z = 1 + eps phi, tws},\n    tws = ngTwisted[ngHW, th, z];\n    Table[Join[<|\"state\" -> i|>, ngRowA[ngHW[[i]], tws[[i]], eps, phi, cp, a, ngX11[[i]], ngVac0[[i]]]], {i, Length[ngHW]}]], {eps, epss}];\nngEpss = {10^-2, 10^-3, 10^-4};\nngTabA1 = ngTabA[ngPhi1, 2., 1/3, ngEpss];\nngFmt[x_] := If[NumericQ[x], If[Abs[x] < 10^-13, 0, ScientificForm[Chop[x, 10^-14], 4]], x];\nngShowA[tab_] := Grid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[Table[With[{r = tab[[j, i]]}, {ngHW[[i]][\"dyn\"], N[r[\"eps\"]], ngFmt[r[\"ov\"]], ngFmt[r[\"ovW\"]], ngFmt[r[\"facN\"]], ngFmt[r[\"Tn\"]], ngFmt[r[\"lim\"]], ngFmt[Abs[r[\"Tn\"] - r[\"lim\"]]], ngFmt[Abs[r[\"lhsT\"] - r[\"lhsF\"]]], ngFmt[Abs[r[\"lhsT\"] - r[\"lhsP\"]]]}], {j, Length[tab]}], {i, {1, 3, 4, 5, 6}}], 1], {\"Dynkin\", \"eps\", \"|<Psi0|Psi_eps>|\", \"<W|Psi_eps>\", \"tau-factor (N-normalised)\", \"product = T_eps\", \"predicted limit\", \"|T_eps - limit|\", \"|LHS_t - RHS_tau|\", \"|LHS_t - LHS_prod|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left];\nngShowA[ngTabA1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
