   "value": "### 3b. The limit bra B* and the HW trick with the finite shift\n\n(i) Vector level: ||bra_eps (transfer-matrix action) - (eps (c+phi4)/z1) N_eps|| / ||bra_eps|| (should vanish: the localisation is exact), and ||N_eps/|N_eps| - B*/|B*||| versus eps (O(eps): the only difference is the A site, e1 + a (z1/z4) e4 -> e1 + a e4).\n(ii) Shift: B* rho(n) with n = exp(-a E14) (A site v -> v(1 - a e14), F site u -> u(1 + a e41), all sites) equals e1 (x) (e4 + (a-a') e1) (x) vac^(L-1), checked as vectors.\n(iii) Overlap identity on the saved untwisted HW states for several (a, a'): <B*|Psi0> = <vac^L|Psi0> + (a-a')<e1e1 vac^(L-1)|Psi0>.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngBstar[a_, ap_] := ngProd[Join[{ngE[1] + a ngE[4], ngE[4] - ap ngE[1]}, Flatten[Table[ngW[a], ngLp - 1], 1]]];\nngShifted[a_, ap_] := ngProd[Join[{ngE[1], ngE[4] + (a - ap) ngE[1]}, Flatten[Table[{ngE[1], ngE[4]}, ngLp - 1], 1]]];\nngShiftBra[a_, ap_] := Module[{gA = IdentityMatrix[4] - a Normal[ngEE[1, 4]], gFinvT = IdentityMatrix[4] + a Normal[ngEE[4, 1]], sv, rest},\n   rest = Flatten[Table[ngW[a], ngLp - 1], 1]; sv = Join[{ngE[1] + a ngE[4], ngE[4] - ap ngE[1]}, rest];\n   ngProd[MapIndexed[If[ngTypes[[First[#2]]] == \"A\", #1 . gA, #1 . gFinvT] &, sv]]];\nngShiftRes = Map[Function[p, With[{a = p[[1]], ap = p[[2]]}, {a, ap, Norm[ngShiftBra[a, ap] - ngShifted[a, ap]], Max[Abs[Table[ngBstar[a, ap] . ngHW[[i]][\"psi\"] - (ngVac0[[i]] + (a - ap) ngX11[[i]]), {i, Length[ngHW]}]]]}]], {{1/3, 2}, {1/3, -4/3}, {-1, 0.7}, {2/5, 2/5}}];\nngBraLim[phi_, cp_, a_, eps_] := Module[{th = ngThABJM + eps ngThDir, z = 1 + eps phi, c1, c12, al, be, Wb, T1a, T1b, y1, bt, ap, Nb, bs},\n   c1 = ngC1[th]; c12 = ngC12[th]; al = (cp eps - 1)/c1; be = 1/c12; Wb = ngProd[ngPairsW[a, ngLp]];\n   T1a = ngT1[th, z, th[[1]]]; T1b = ngT1[th, z, th[[2]]]; y1 = LinearSolve[Transpose[T1a], Wb]; bt = al y1 + be (y1 . T1b);\n   ap = a (cp + phi[[1]])/(cp + phi[[4]]);\n   Nb = ngProd[Join[{ngE[1] + a z[[1]]/z[[4]] ngE[4], ngE[4] - ap ngE[1]}, Flatten[Table[ngW[a], ngLp - 1], 1]]]; bs = ngBstar[a, ap];\n   {eps, Norm[bt - eps (cp + phi[[4]])/z[[1]] Nb]/Norm[bt], Norm[Nb/Norm[Nb] - bs/Norm[bs]]}];\nngBraLimRows = Table[ngBraLim[ngPhi1, 2., 1/3, e], {e, ngEpss}];\nngFmt[x_] := If[NumericQ[x], If[Abs[x] < 10^-13, 0, ScientificForm[Chop[x, 10^-14], 4]], x];\nGrid[Join[{{\"shift test: a\", \"a'\", \"|B* rho(n) - shifted|\", \"max_states |<B*|Psi0> - (vac + (a-a')X)|\"}}, Map[ngFmt /@ # &, ngShiftRes], {{\"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"eps\", \"bra_eps vs N_eps (rel)\", \"|N_eps - B*| (normalised)\", \"\"}}, Map[Append[ngFmt /@ #, \"\"] &, ngBraLimRows]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
