  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3c. phi- and c-independence, convergence rates\n\nSame table with phi2 = (1.3, -0.2, 0.5, -0.7), c = 2, and with phi1, c = 0.5. The limit depends on (phi, c) only through a' = a (c+phi1)/(c+phi4): the quantity (T_eps - <vac^L|Psi0>)/(a - a') should tend to X = <e1e1 vac^(L-1)|Psi0> in every case, state by state. Last table: rate log10(err(eps)/err(eps/10)) of |T_eps - limit| (about 1 = O(eps), about 2 = O(eps^2)).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngTabA2 = ngTabA[ngPhi2, 2., 1/3, ngEpss];\nngTabA3 = ngTabA[ngPhi1, 0.5, 1/3, ngEpss];\nngIndepRows = Flatten[Table[With[{tab = pr[[2]]}, Table[{pr[[1]], ngHW[[i]][\"dyn\"], N[tab[[3, i]][\"ap\"]], N[tab[[j, i]][\"eps\"]], ngFmt[(tab[[j, i]][\"Tn\"] - ngVac0[[i]])/(1/3 - tab[[j, i]][\"ap\"])], ngFmt[ngX11[[i]]]}, {j, 3}]], {pr, {{\"phi1, c=2\", ngTabA1}, {\"phi2, c=2\", ngTabA2}, {\"phi1, c=0.5\", ngTabA3}}}, {i, {1, 3, 4, 5, 6}}], 2];\nngRateRows = Flatten[Table[With[{tab = pr[[2]]}, {pr[[1]], ngHW[[i]][\"dyn\"], Sequence @@ Table[N[Log10[Max[Abs[tab[[j, i]][\"Tn\"] - tab[[j, i]][\"lim\"]], 10^-17]/Max[Abs[tab[[j + 1, i]][\"Tn\"] - tab[[j + 1, i]][\"lim\"]], 10^-17]]], {j, 2}]}], {pr, {{\"phi1, c=2\", ngTabA1}, {\"phi2, c=2\", ngTabA2}, {\"phi1, c=0.5\", ngTabA3}}}, {i, {3, 5, 6}}], 1];\nGrid[Join[{{\"(phi, c)\", \"Dynkin\", \"a'\", \"eps\", \"(T_eps - <vac|Psi0>)/(a-a')\", \"X = <e1e1 vac|Psi0>\"}}, ngIndepRows, {{\"(phi, c)\", \"Dynkin\", \"rate 1e-2 -> 1e-3\", \"rate 1e-3 -> 1e-4\", \"\", \"\"}}, Map[Join[#, {\"\", \"\"}] /. x_Real :> NumberForm[x, 3] &, ngRateRows]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
