  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Control: family (b) with kappa = 1 - c eps\n\nbra_b = <W_a^L|(1 - (kappa/c1) t1(th1)^-1) = <W_a^L| rho1(1 - kappa Lambda^-1) = (eps (c+phi1)/z1) N_b,  N_b = ((e1 + a''_eps e4) (x) (e4 - a e1)) (x) W_a^(L-1),  a''_eps = a (c+phi4) z1/((c+phi1) z4) -> a'' = a (c+phi4)/(c+phi1).\n\nHW trick with n = exp(-aE14): <B**|Psi0> = <vac^L|Psi0> + (a'' - a) <e4e4 vac^(L-1)|Psi0>.\n\nSpecial case kappa = z4, i.e. c = -phi4, a = -1: a'' = 0 exactly, N_b = e1 (x) (e4 + e1) (x) W_-1^(L-1) = the project's B_1 (section 5.5 bra), and bra_b = (1 - z4/z1) B_1, so T_eps = <B_1|Psi_eps> exactly (section 5.5 formula, divergent 1/(1 - z4/z1) = z1/(eps(phi1-phi4)) included); its limit is C_1. Columns `dir` = <B_1|Psi_eps> computed directly.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngRowB[st_, tw_, eps_, phi_, cp_, a_, X44_, V0_] := Module[{psi = tw[[1]], th = ngThABJM + eps ngThDir, z = 1 + eps phi, c1, kap, Wb, T1a, y1, lhsT, k, tau1, ovW, rhs, app, appEps, Nb, lhsP, Tn, lim, rest, B1},\n   c1 = ngC1[th]; kap = 1 - cp eps; Wb = ngProd[ngPairsW[a, ngLp]]; T1a = ngT1[th, z, th[[1]]];\n   y1 = LinearSolve[Transpose[T1a], Wb]; lhsT = (Wb - kap/c1 y1) . psi;\n   k = Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]]; tau1 = (T1a . psi)[[k]]/psi[[k]]; ovW = Wb . psi; rhs = (1 - kap/(c1 tau1)) ovW;\n   app = a (cp + phi[[4]])/(cp + phi[[1]]); appEps = app z[[1]]/z[[4]]; rest = Flatten[Table[ngW[a], ngLp - 1], 1];\n   Nb = ngProd[Join[{ngE[1] + appEps ngE[4], ngE[4] - a ngE[1]}, rest]];\n   lhsP = eps (cp + phi[[1]])/z[[1]] (Nb . psi); Tn = lhsT z[[1]]/(eps (cp + phi[[1]])); lim = V0 + (app - a) X44;\n   B1 = ngProd[Join[{ngE[1], ngE[4] + ngE[1]}, Flatten[Table[{ngE[1] - ngE[4], ngE[4] + ngE[1]}, ngLp - 1], 1]]];\n   <|\"eps\" -> eps, \"ov\" -> tw[[2]], \"ovW\" -> ovW, \"facN\" -> rhs/ovW z[[1]]/(eps (cp + phi[[1]])), \"lhsT\" -> lhsT, \"rhs\" -> rhs, \"lhsP\" -> lhsP, \"Tn\" -> Tn, \"lim\" -> lim, \"app\" -> app, \"dir\" -> B1 . psi|>];\nngTabB[phi_, cp_, a_, epss_] := Table[Module[{th = ngThABJM + eps ngThDir, z = 1 + eps phi, tws},\n    tws = ngTwisted[ngHW, th, z];\n    Table[Join[<|\"state\" -> i|>, ngRowB[ngHW[[i]], tws[[i]], eps, phi, cp, a, ngX44[[i]], ngVac0[[i]]]], {i, Length[ngHW]}]], {eps, epss}];\nngTabB1 = ngTabB[ngPhi1, 2., 1/3, ngEpss];\nngTabB2 = ngTabB[ngPhi1, -ngPhi1[[4]], -1, ngEpss];\nngShowB[tab_] := Grid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[Table[With[{r = tab[[j, i]]}, {ngHW[[i]][\"dyn\"], N[r[\"eps\"]], N[r[\"app\"]], ngFmt[r[\"ovW\"]], ngFmt[r[\"facN\"]], ngFmt[r[\"Tn\"]], ngFmt[r[\"lim\"]], ngFmt[Abs[r[\"Tn\"] - r[\"lim\"]]], ngFmt[Abs[r[\"lhsT\"] - r[\"rhs\"]]], ngFmt[Abs[r[\"lhsT\"] - r[\"lhsP\"]]], ngFmt[r[\"dir\"]]}], {j, Length[tab]}], {i, {1, 3, 4, 5, 6}}], 1], {\"Dynkin\", \"eps\", \"a''\", \"<W|Psi_eps>\", \"tau-factor (N-normalised)\", \"T_eps\", \"limit\", \"|T_eps - limit|\", \"|LHS_t - RHS_tau|\", \"|LHS_t - LHS_prod|\", \"dir = <B_1|Psi_eps>\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left];\nGrid[{{\"(b) a = 1/3, c = 2\"}, {ngShowB[ngTabB1]}, {\"(b) a = -1, c = -phi4 (kappa = z4: section 5.5 case); limit should be C_1\"}, {ngShowB[ngTabB2]}}, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
