  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. The end-growing chain  t1(th1)^-1 t1(th2) t1(th3)^-1 (alpha + beta t1(th4))  (L = 2 pairs)\n\nSites 1-3 get the fixed rotations (Lambda^-1, Lambda, Lambda^-1) (all -> 1 as z -> 1) and the F site 4 of pair 2 the free rotation alpha'' + beta'' Lambda with alpha'' + beta'' = c eps. Exact check at the rational point (constants c3, c4 of y3 = W t1(th1)^-1 t1(th2) t1(th3)^-1 and y4 = y3 t1(th4)), then the eps-limit: T_eps = <bra_chain|Psi_eps>/(eps (c+phi4)) against V0 + (a - a') <vac (x) e1e1|Psi0> (HW trick with n = exp(-a E14) on all pairs: pair 1 -> vac, pair 2 -> e1 (x) (e4 + (a-a') e1)).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ngChainExact[sv_, th_, z_] := Module[{bra = ngProd[sv], T = Table[ngT1[th, z, th[[s]]], {s, 4}], y1, y2, y3, y4, Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z], LamI = DiagonalMatrix[1/z], e3, e4},\n   y1 = ngInvAct[bra, T[[1]]]; y2 = y1 . T[[2]]; y3 = ngInvAct[y2, T[[3]]]; y4 = y3 . T[[4]];\n   e3 = ngProd[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[sv, 1, LamI], 2, Lam], 3, LamI]]; e4 = ngProd[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[sv, 1, LamI], 2, Lam], 3, LamI], 4, Lam]];\n   {ngRatio[y3, e3], ngRatio[y4, e4]}];\nngChainEx = ngChainExact[ngRefW, ngTh0, ngZ0];\nngX11b = (ngProd[Join[Flatten[Table[{ngE[1], ngE[4]}, ngLp - 1], 1], {ngE[1], ngE[1]}]] . #[\"psi\"]) & /@ ngHW;\nngRowChain[tw_, eps_, phi_, cp_, a_, X_, V0_] := Module[{psi = tw[[1]], th = ngThABJM + eps ngThDir, z = 1 + eps phi, sv = ngPairsW[a, 2], T, bra, y1, y2, y3, y4, Lam, LamI, e3, e4, c3, c4, al, be, bch, expc, ap},\n   Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z]; LamI = DiagonalMatrix[1/z]; T = Table[ngT1[th, z, th[[s]]], {s, 4}]; bra = ngProd[sv];\n   y1 = ngInvAct[bra, T[[1]]]; y2 = y1 . T[[2]]; y3 = ngInvAct[y2, T[[3]]]; y4 = y3 . T[[4]];\n   e3 = ngProd[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[sv, 1, LamI], 2, Lam], 3, LamI]]; e4 = ngProd[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[ngRotSite[sv, 1, LamI], 2, Lam], 3, LamI], 4, Lam]];\n   c3 = ngRatio[y3, e3][[1]]; c4 = ngRatio[y4, e4][[1]]; al = (cp eps - 1)/c3; be = 1/c4; bch = al y3 + be y4;\n   expc = ngProd[{sv[[1]] . LamI, sv[[2]] . Lam, sv[[3]] . LamI, sv[[4]] . ((cp eps - 1) IdentityMatrix[4] + Lam)}];\n   ap = a (cp + phi[[1]])/(cp + phi[[4]]);\n   <|\"eps\" -> eps, \"c3\" -> c3, \"c4\" -> c4, \"res\" -> Norm[bch - expc]/Norm[bch], \"ovW\" -> bra . psi, \"Tn\" -> (bch . psi)/(eps (cp + phi[[4]])), \"lim\" -> V0 + (a - ap) X|>];\nngChainIdx = {1, 3, 4, 5, 6};\nngChainRows = Flatten[Table[Module[{th = ngThABJM + eps ngThDir, z = 1 + eps ngPhi1, tws},\n     tws = ngTwisted[ngHW[[ngChainIdx]], th, z];\n     Table[With[{i = ngChainIdx[[m]], r = ngRowChain[tws[[m]], eps, ngPhi1, 2., 1/3, ngX11b[[ngChainIdx[[m]]]], ngVac0[[ngChainIdx[[m]]]]]}, {ngHW[[i]][\"dyn\"], N[eps], ngFmt[r[\"res\"]], ngFmt[r[\"ovW\"]], ngFmt[r[\"Tn\"]], ngFmt[r[\"lim\"]], ngFmt[Abs[r[\"Tn\"] - r[\"lim\"]]]}], {m, 5}]], {eps, {10^-3, 10^-4}}], 1];\nColumn[{Grid[{{\"exact y3: (c3, dev, zero-comp)\", ngChainEx[[1]]}, {\"exact y4: (c4, dev, zero-comp)\", ngChainEx[[2]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Prepend[ngChainRows, {\"Dynkin\", \"eps\", \"|bra_chain - expected|/|bra|\", \"<W|Psi_eps>\", \"T_eps\", \"limit V0 + (a-a')<vac e1e1|Psi0>\", \"|T_eps - limit|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
